# A pull request that changes one of these files needs the approval of one of its owners, on
# top of green CI (see "Branches" in AGENTS.md). The author cannot approve their own pull
# request, so a change by one owner is approved by the other. These are the security barriers,
# what decides which code runs and how the app updates itself.

